# NOTE: the Level 2 row below (`.......43......`) reads `32` in the upstream
# file — a swapped quadrant char that makes the tile anchored at (15,2)
# fail parse_layout()'s quadrant check (2/3/4 must sit at exact 2x2 offsets
# from the '1' anchor; expected '4' at (15,y+1) and '3' at (16,y+1), not
# '3'/'2'). Fixed here to the geometrically correct `43`.
# Board size in quarter tiles
w32
h16
# Board depth
d4
